@host = http://localhost:5080

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Test payment (Development: Payments:Verifier=Test) — cria pedido e chama o fornecedor mock
POST {{host}}/webhook/payment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentId": "PAY-DEV-1",
  "productKey": "rack",
  "quantity": 1,
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "name": "Jane Buyer",
  "line1": "123 Main St",
  "city": "Austin",
  "state": "TX",
  "zip": "78701",
  "countryCode": "US",
  "phone": "+15551234567",
  "amount": 34.99,
  "currency": "USD"
}

### CJ tracking webhook — anexa rastreio (usar o supplierOrderId retornado em /orders)
POST {{host}}/webhook/cj
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "MOCK-PAY-DEV-1",
  "trackNumber": "LP123456789CN"
}

### Orders dashboard (setar X-Api-Key se Orders:ApiKey estiver configurado)
GET {{host}}/orders
X-Api-Key: dev-key
